Patch 30 -- experimental separable stage for programmable VS + FFP PS.

This is the previously built p30 source diff that was missing from the exported
patch series. It is retained for reproducibility but OFF by default behind
MGS2_GL_SEPARABLE_VS.

The real save/gameplay route measured 27 monolithic links costing 5,765 ms, but
the corrected probe later showed no eligible programmable-VS/FFP-PS pairs in the
actual workload. Enabling this patch therefore changed nothing. Do not enable it
in production; its value here is to make the recovered source and archived
wined3d_p30_separable_vs.dll reproducible before patch 32.

